        "created_at": "2013-05-07T14:36:19.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I love the theradin.  The neo elf assassins ship plays to one of my favorite tactics.  hit and run.  they have the ability to do small amounts of damage and get the heck outta dodge.  sure there not like the Warbeast who can go toe to toe with the opposition,  but they serve a pretty fun role while jetting about the galaxy.</p>\n<p>hard to say more without giving too much away lol</p>",
