        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"XChylde\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/xchylde/48/2559_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> XChylde:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Obviously she has a mechanic allowing to engage ships in more than 1 sector at a time. That sounds awesome.&nbsp;</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Actually this isn't entirely true. Without getting into specific details, the mechanics don't allow this. However, she can [redacted] in two Sectors a round, or [redacted] in one Sector and [redeacted] in another Sector. She can engage an enemy ship then [redacted]. She can avoid [redacted] then [redacted]. She can…etc.</p>",
