        "id": 62504,
        "name": "Chaosmancer",
        "username": "Chaosmancer",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/chaosmancer/{size}/1977_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-05-07T19:32:04.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"imprimis5\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/imprimis5/48/2387_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> imprimis5:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Trust me, Conclave of Niphon can hold its own. The strategy isn't as straight-forward as the other War Spectre ship, though. You'll find, as has been mentioned elsewhere, that each race has a ship that is low complexity and a ship that is higher complexity.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>I haven't heard about the complexities before. Without giving too much away could you list them out? For example, I'll assume the Fjarlspire (0 attack) is more complex than the Grey Bomber? But I'm curious to hear from someone who isn't guessing</p>",
